  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0502.phylarchos.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0502.phylarchos.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0502.phylarchos.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0502_phylarchos"><head>ΦΥΛΑΡΧΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0502_phylarchos">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-6-l1" xml:lang="grc">γαστρισμὸς ἔσται δαψιλής· τὰ προοίμια</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-6-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὁρῶ . . . . . χορτασθήσομαι.</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-6-l3" xml:lang="grc">νὴ τὸν Διόνυσον, ἄνδρες, ἤδη στρηνιῶ.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 3, 100a Σώφιλος ἐν Φυλάρχῳ κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">v. 2 explere conati sunt Iacobs. Add. Ath. 66. Mein. Anal. Ath. 45. Herwerd. Mnem. nov. IIII 299. taedet talia tentamina referre. de verbo στρηνιᾶν cf. Antiphan. 82.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0502_phylarchos">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0502-phylarchos-7-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὀψοφάγος εἶ καὶ κνισολοιχός.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 3, 125e ὁ κνισολοῖχος (scr. κνισολοιχός) ἔστι παρὰ μὲν Σωφίλῳ ἐν Φιλάρχῳ οὕτως κτλ. Eustathius 1817,38 ὥσπερ τὸ κτλ.</note>
            </div>
